MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_CARD_SEVENTY_FIVE.desc:
Deal {Damage:diff()} [color=#CC6666]damage[/color],
for each [color=#CC6666]【Transmigration】[/color] card in your [color=#CC6666]draw pile[/color],
gain {Block:diff()} [color=#CC6666]Block[/color]

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_ELEVATOR_TRIAL.descrip:
[color=#CC6666]【Endless Fall】[/color]
Deal {Damage:diff()} [color=#CC6666]damage[/color]. After playing, shuffle back into the [color=#CC6666]draw pile[/color]. Each time played this combat, [color=#CC6666]damage[/color] +{RecursionDamage:diff()}
[b]Exhaust[/b] 1 random non-[color=#CC6666]Attack[/color] card in hand

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_CARD_EIGHTY_SIX.descri:
Deal {Damage:diff()} [color=#CC6666]damage[/color]
Draw {Cards:diff()} [color=#CC6666]cards[/color]{CompPost}
randomly [b]attach[/b] to 1 card in the [color=#CC6666]draw pile[/color]

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_THE_THREE_GARRIDEBS.de:
Gain 5 [color=#33ccff]Block[/color],
{IfUpgraded:show:, draw 1 [color=#33ccff]card[/color]|}
If you triggered
[color=#33ccff]【Case Reversal】[/color] this [color=33ccff]turn[/color], gain {energyPrefix:energyIcons(3)}

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_EMOTION_SURGE.descript:
[color=33ccff]This turn[/color], for each card played,
[rainbow][b]Emotion[/b][/rainbow] +1 extra
When you gain an [rainbow]Emotion[/rainbow] card, restore {energyPrefix:energyIcons(1)}

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_PERPETUAL_FRENZY.descr:
Double your current [rainbow][b]【Emotion】[/b][/rainbow] stacks.
If this caused you to gain [rainbow][b]【Emotion】[/b][/rainbow] cards, 1 random card in hand costs 0 [color=33ccff]this turn[/color]{IfUpgraded:show:|
[color=#33ccff]Remove[/color]}

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_EMOTION_DIVERGE.descri:
If [rainbow][b]【Emotion】[/b][/rainbow] is greater than 6 stacks: deal {Damage:diff()} [color=#33ccff]damage[/color] to enemies.
If [rainbow][b]【Emotion】[/b][/rainbow] is 6 or fewer stacks: gain {Block:diff()} [color=#33ccff]Block[/color]{IfUpgraded:show:
gain [rainbow][b]【Emotion】[/b][/rainbow] stacks equal to the number of living allies|}

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_FINAL_FAREWELL.descrip:
Clear [b]【Witchification】[/b]
{IfUpgraded:show:Immediately record 80 [color=#33ccff]【Storm】[/color]|}
[thinky_dots][b][color=#33ccff]「When the storm passes, beneath the sun there will be a[/color][/b][/thinky_dots][b][thinky_dots][green] cleaner, finer, firmer land」[/green][/thinky_dots][/b]

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_BOND_VERDICT.descripti:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage to enemies, allies gain {Block:diff()} Block
If [color=#ff99cc][b]「Affinity」[/b][/color] > [color=#CC6666][b]「Estrangement」[/b][/color]
give allies {IfUpgraded:show:[color=#ff99cc][b]「Affinity」[/b][/color]'s full positive ability|[color=#ff99cc][b]「Affinity」[/b][/color]'s half positive ability}
If [color=#CC6666][b]「Estrangement」[/b][/color] > [color=#ff99cc][b]「Affinity」[/b][/color]
give enemies {IfUpgraded:show:[color=#CC6666][b]「Estrangement」[/b][/color]'s full negative ability|[color=#CC6666][b]「Estrangement」[/b][/color]'s half negative ability}

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_ANANLIN_INTERROGATION_:
Gain {Silence:diff()} stacks of [color=#6666cc]【Silence】[/color].
After the next time you play an [b]Attack card[/b],
gain {energyPrefix:energyIcons(1)}

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_ANANLIN_OPPRESSIVE_SIL:
The first time each [color=#6666cc]turn[/color] you exhaust
[color=#6666cc]【Silence】[/color], gain {energyPrefix:energyIcons(1)}
subsequent times instead draw 1 [color=#6666cc]card[/color].
Every 4 cycles
{IfUpgraded:show:when played, gain {energyPrefix:energyIcons(1)}|}

Generate 1 card from a recorded card pool; it gains [b]Exhaust[/b] and [b]Ethereal[/b].
If no card pool is recorded, gain {FallbackSilence:diff()} stacks of [color=#6666cc]【Silence】[/color]
{IfUpgraded:show:The generated card can be played once for free this turn|}

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_ANANLIN_NOAHS_BUTTERFL:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage to all enemies.
If any enemy's [color=#6666cc]intent[/color] is an [b]Attack[/b], give everyone [blue]【Butterfly】[/blue] and immediately apply 1 random replacement-intent effect;
if none has an [color=#6666cc]intent[/color] to attack, [color=#6666cc]【Silence】[/color] replacement-intent value +1, and return this card to your hand [color=#6666cc]next turn[/color]

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_ANANLIN_THE_PRISON_IS_:
Whenever you give an enemy [color=#6666cc]【Silenced】[/color] [color=#6666cc]this turn[/color],
enter the [color=#6666cc]【Cell】[/color]
{IfUpgraded:show:When played, gain {energyPrefix:energyIcons(1)}|}

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_ANANLIN_AFTER_AWAKENIN:
If you lost [color=#6666cc]【Reassurance】[/color] [color=#6666cc]this turn[/color], draw {Cards:diff()} [color=#6666cc]cards[/color].
Otherwise, gain 1 stack of [color=#6666cc]【Reassurance】[/color]
For each stack of [color=#6666cc]【Reassurance】[/color], gain 1 {energyPrefix:energyIcons(1)}

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_ANANLIN_PUSH_THE_DOOR_:
Deal {Damage:diff()} [color=#6666cc]damage[/color] {Hits:diff()} times.
If you have [color=#6666cc]【Reassurance】[/color], lose up to 2 stacks; for each stack lost, deal the same [color=#6666cc]damage[/color] to all enemies again
For each stack of [color=#6666cc]【Reassurance】[/color], each hit of this card +{PeaceBonus:diff()}

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_ANANLIN_TEAR_DIRTY_PAG:
Deal {Damage:diff()} [color=#6666cc]damage[/color].
You may Exhaust up to {MaxExhaust:diff()} cards from your hand, then gain 1 [color=#6666cc]【Blank Page】[/color].
If it is a Status card, additionally gain {energyPrefix:energyIcons(1)}

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_ANANLIN_FINISHED_DRAFT:
Gain {Vigor:diff()} stacks of [blue]Vigor[/blue]
{Vigor:diff()} is the number of [blue]other-card-pool[/blue] cards played [blue]this combat[/blue] plus {Inherited:diff()}
Deal {Damage:diff()} [color=#6666cc]damage[/color] {Hits:diff()} times
{Hits:diff()} is the number of [color=#6666cc]intent[/color] rewrites [color=#6666cc]this combat[/color] plus {Inherited:diff()}

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_ANANLIN_BACKSTAGE_RESE:
Gain {Peace:diff()} stacks of [color=#6666cc]【Reassurance】[/color] and {Silence:diff()} stacks of [color=#6666cc]【Silence】[/color].
At [color=#6666cc]start of each turn[/color], trigger [color=#6666cc]【Audition】[/color]: consume your current [color=#6666cc]【Reassurance】[/color] stacks and randomly trigger that many effects
{IfUpgraded:show:The first triggered effect triggers one extra time|}

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_SIN_OFFERING.descripti:
Exhaust up to {IfUpgraded:show:2|1} hand card(s);
if an exhausted card is a [b]Original Sin[/b], exhaust 1 more random hand card;
if none of the exhausted cards were [b]Original Sins[/b], add a [b]Original Sin[/b] to your hand

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_ZHI_MING_HUAN_YA.descr:
Put 1 [b]Original Sin[/b] from your [color=#ff0000]discard pile[/color] on the bottom of your [color=#ff0000]draw pile[/color], then draw 1 [color=#ff0000]card[/color];
if there is none in the [color=#ff0000]discard pile[/color], you may choose to add 1 [b]Original Sin[/b] to it.
{IfUpgraded:show:Gain {energyPrefix:energyIcons(1)}.|}

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_KUAN_SHU_YIN_JI.descri:
Each time you [color=#00ffff]forgive[/color] an [b]Original Sin[/b], gain 1 stack;
at the start of next turn, draw [color=#ff0000]cards[/color] equal to your stacks{IfUpgraded:show:
keep up to 4 stacks.|
then reset.}

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_XUN_HUAN_FA_DIAN.descr:
Whenever you [color=#00ffff]forgive[/color] or [color=#ff0000]Punish[/color],
if that [b]Original Sin[/b] card would enter the [color=#ff0000]discard pile[/color] or [color=#ff0000]exhaust pile[/color], put it on top of the [color=#ff0000]draw pile[/color] instead;
then, for each [b]Original Sin[/b] among [color=#ff0000]all your cards[/color], randomly trigger that many [b]Original Sin[/b] card effects.

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_DONTLOOKATME.descripti:
Choose 1 card in hand to gain [color=#ff0000]Embers[/color];
the next time a card is burned by [color=#ff0000]Embers[/color] [color=#ff0000]this turn[/color], draw 1 [color=#ff0000]card[/color].
{IfUpgraded:show:Gain 6 [color=#ff0000]Block[/color].|}

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_UNNEEDEDGOODCHILD.desc:
[color=#ff0000]Embers[/color] fuel: [color=#ff0000]kindle[/color] the next [color=#ff0000]Embers[/color] this turn, dealing 1 [color=#ff0000]damage[/color] a number of times equal to the burned card's cost;
if its cost is greater than 3 and it has [color=#ff0000]Embers[/color] itself, gain {Energy:energyIcons()} then play it.
You may right-click or two-finger tap again to [color=#ff0000]kindle[/color] 1 candidate card.

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_BEFOREFORGIVEN.descrip:
Deal {Damage:diff()} [color=#ff0000]damage[/color];
if [color=#ff0000]Embers[/color] successfully burn a card this time, deal {BurnDamage:diff()} [color=#ff0000]damage[/color];
if a card costing more than 2 is burned, reduce its cost by 1 and return it to your hand.

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_STAYINGSTILLHURTS.desc:
Exhaust 1 card in hand.
If it has [color=#ff0000]Embers[/color], randomly trigger the card-selection of 1 [color=#ff0000]Embers[/color] card among all your cards, and its cost this play {IfUpgraded:show:-2|-1};
otherwise draw 1 [color=#ff0000]card[/color].

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_BURNEDECHO.description:
Deal {Damage:diff()} [color=#ff0000]damage[/color].
For each card burned by [color=#ff0000]Embers[/color] [color=#ff0000]this turn[/color], this card's [color=#ff0000]damage[/color] +{BurnBonus:diff()};
after it is played, its cost +1 until [color=#ff0000]the start of next turn[/color].

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_UNSEENKINDLING.descrip:
Choose 1 enemy.
If it has no [color=#ff0000]Fire Color[/color], give 2 slots of [color=#ff0000]Fire Color[/color];
if it already has [color=#ff0000]Fire Color[/color], give 1 slot of [color=#ff0000]Fire Color[/color]
and draw {Cards:diff()} [color=#ff0000]cards[/color].{IfUpgraded:show:
Gain {Block:diff()} [color=#ff0000]Block[/color].|}

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_MERURU_COWARDICE.descr:
[color=#ffcc99]While in hand[/color]
whenever you gain [color=#ffcc99]Block[/color], reduce it by 2;
if your [color=#ffcc99]Block[/color] is greater than 15, reduce by 1 more

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_SHERRY_VOID.descriptio:
[color=#33ccff]While in hand[/color]
the [color=#33ccff]damage[/color] you deal below 13 is halved;
if you deal halved [color=#33ccff]damage[/color], gain 1 stack of [b]Temporary Strength[/b]

ManosabaLin.Originalsin.ArisaGuilt.hover:
[color=#cccccc]Automatically Retained[/color] at [color=#ff0000]end of turn[/color]
When you [color=#cccccc]Retain[/color] to [color=#00ffff]「Forgive」[/color],
[color=#ff0000]the value of 1 stack of Alisa's Magic granted +1[/color]; next turn, if you have Alisa's Magic and grant an enemy 10 stacks of Alisa's Magic, immediately trigger the magic's effect, then gain {energyPrefix:energyIcons(1)}
When you [color=#cccccc]play[/color] to [color=#ff0000]「Punish」[/color],
gain Alisa's Magic equal to your max HP; for every [color=#ff0000]10 stacks[/color] gained, gain 1 {energyPrefix:energyIcons(1)}

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_EMAREGRET.description:
[color=#ff99cc]While in hand[/color]
whenever you play a card, lose 1 [color=#ff99cc]HP[/color];
if your [color=#ff99cc]Block[/color] is greater than 13, lose 1 [color=#ff99cc]Block[/color] instead

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_FLOWER_BLOOM.descripti:
Choose 1 ally: this turn,
when they transform a card, they may instead transform it into Ema's 1-cost Exhaust [gold]「Estrangement」[/gold] card;
when they generate a card, they may instead generate Ema's 1-cost Exhaust [gold]「Affinity」[/gold] card;
[gold]「Affinity」[/gold] and [gold]「Estrangement」[/gold] cards they play always trigger their extra effects

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_LINK_THE_FIRE_EFFECT.d:
Light up 1 random card among all your cards (at most 4 lit at once), giving it [color=#88cc33]Great Soul[/color].{IfUpgraded:show:
Give a random ally 12 instances of 1 [color=#88cc33]Block[/color]; if its Block is the lowest among allies, it also recovers 1 HP.|}
Then spend your current Soul Count ({SoulCap:diff()}): split it randomly into parts of 1-3 (every split equally likely). Each part ignites once, rolling one random effect from the [b]Ember[/b] (1) / [b]Blaze[/b] (2) / [b]Inferno[/b] (3) pool.

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_USURP_THE_FLAME_EFFECT:
Deal {Damage:diff()} [color=#ffcc44]damage[/color].
The first time you play it each combat, permanently gain 1 [color=#ffcc44]King Soul[/color]
Each [color=#ffcc44]King Soul[/color] adds {IfUpgraded:show:5|3} damage.{IfUpgraded:show:
Remove up to 20 [color=#ff0000]Block[/color] from all allies and convert it into [color=#ffcc44]Temp HP[/color].|}
You may right-click or two-finger tap to spend 4 [color=#ffcc44]King Souls[/color] to strengthen this card;
after strengthening, playing this card additionally grants 1 [color=#ffcc44]extra turn[/color].

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_EXTINGUISH_FLAME_EFFEC:
Halve the [color=#6666cc]damage[/color] dealt by you and all enemies.{IfUpgraded:show:
Gain 15 [color=#6666cc]Block[/color] at the start of each turn.|}
your [color=#6666cc]Block[/color] no longer disappears at the start of a turn.

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_COMBUSTION_SHARED.desc:
Deal {Damage:diff()} [color=#ff0000]damage[/color].
This [color=#ff0000]Embers[/color] also links 1 [color=#ff0000]Attack card[/color] from a random teammate's [color=#ff0000]discard pile[/color];
when that card is burned, you and its owner each auto-play it once.
